Sarah's Oil is a drama film directed by Cyrus Nowrasteh.

3
00:18:10,588 --> 00:18:16,588
Sarah Rector, an African-American girl born in Oklahoma Indian Territory in the early 1900s, believes
there is oil beneath the barren land she’s allotted, and her faith is proven right.

4
00:24:14,117 --> 00:24:20,117
As greedy oil sharks close in, Sarah turns to her family, friends, and some Texas wildcatters to maintain control of her
oil-rich land, eventually becoming among the nation's first female African-American millionaires—at eleven years old.

