01:06:38,823 --> 01:06:44,823
Sarah's Oil is a 2025 American biographical drama film regarding Sarah Rector,
being directed, co-produced, and co-written by Cyrus Nowrasteh.

12
01:12:42,352 --> 01:12:48,352
It is inspired by the 2014 book Searching for Sarah Rector: The
Richest Black Girl in America by Tonya Bolden.

13
01:18:45,882 --> 01:18:51,882
It stars Zachary Levi, Naya Desir-Johnson, Sonequa
Martin-Green, and Garret Dillahunt.

14
01:24:49,411 --> 01:24:55,411
Released theatrically by Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer through Amazon MGM Studios on November 7, 2025, Sarah's Oil received generally positive reviews from critics and was fourth in the box office
during its opening week; eleventh highest domestic grossing movie during November 2025 out of 128 movies released that year; and 106 highest domestic grossing movie of 2025 .

